1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,965
Five things you must never do in Vatican City.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,398
Don't wear shorts or tank tops.

3
00:00:06,428 --> 00:00:09,409
Only visitors with covered shoulders and knees get in.

4
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:11,990
Don't use flash in the museums.

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,214
It's strictly forbidden.

6
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:16,295
Don't take photos in the Sistine Chapel.

7
00:00:16,325 --> 00:00:19,000
You can shoot almost everywhere else, but not there.

8
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:22,460
Don't sit or eat on the monuments in Rome.

9
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:24,744
It can bring a fine, or even an arrest.

10
00:00:25,774 --> 00:00:29,184
And don't walk around Rome shirtless or in swimwear.

11
00:00:29,214 --> 00:00:30,243
It's an offence.
